{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8d7d6006945d280a872","chatId":"6e35f35991c04398a69abb3042b8bda8","sessionId":null,"userId":69028,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"F\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"F\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":930,"promptTokens":1492,"completionTokens":20,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:31"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004068510564865491,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8d7d6006945d280a86e","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369751036,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:31","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8d7d6006945d280a86e","chatId":"6e35f35991c04398a69abb3042b8bda8","sessionId":null,"userId":69028,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n小珐和家人受邀去邻居家吃晚餐。小珐的邻居詹妮最近由于一些伦理原因正在素食。晚餐时，詹妮亲手做了一份美味的素千层面。小珐并不知道她正在素食，尝了一口后露出了嫌弃的表情。她问詹妮为什么不加肉，味道会更好。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，詹妮最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 娱乐\nB) 反感\nC) 感激\nD) 期待\nE) 开心\nF) 伤心\n\n## 问题 2\n詹妮为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 她的邻居批评她做的菜，并对它感到厌恶\nB) 她很高兴法蒂玛喜欢她的食物\nC) 法蒂玛建议把肉放在烤宽面条里会更好\nD) 詹妮不喜欢她做的菜。","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004068510564865491,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8d7d6006945d280a872","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369751033,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:31","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"0c759e4d462d4b4e9345980d53345e64"}